# Implementation plan — Spec 1.12.3

## Summary

Expand the WebOnOne **Data** left-nav group to **Tags**, **Units**, **Attributes**, **Products**, **Services**, and **Spaces** using the existing **iframe embed** channel (Email/SMS parity). Extend `@webonone/platform-nav` Data sentinels; update WebOnOne icons + peer default; verify Data embed; extend satellite path→sentinel maps. Remove **Data Catalog** (dashboard) from the **core** Data group — keep it on standalone Data only.

See [02-webonone-data-catalog-nav.md](./02-webonone-data-catalog-nav.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.12.3` |
| Prerequisite | Data service from 1.11.0 runnable (`dev:data`); Email/SMS multi-child nav from 1.12.1–1.12.2 as pattern reference |
| Services for manual test | Identity + WebOnOne + Data |
| New env | None (`VITE_DATA_ORIGIN` already present) |
| Packages | Rebuild / type-check `@webonone/platform-nav` before consumer type-check if needed |

---

## Phase 1 — platform-nav

**Goal:** Six Data sentinels + six-child group; drop core Data Catalog.

**Exit criteria:** Member nav has no Data; main/superAdmin resolve six Data hrefs when `externalOrigins.data` set (order: tags → spaces); no dashboard child in core defs.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Sentinels + helpers + nav defs | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.ts` |
| Exports | `packages/platform-nav/src/index.ts` |
| Tests | `packages/platform-nav/src/coreNav.test.ts` |

**Verify:** package tests + type-check for platform-nav.

---

## Phase 2 — WebOnOne + Data + satellites

**Goal:** Icons, default peer path `/tags`, embed verify, Identity/Email/SMS maps.

**Exit criteria:** All six Data children load correct iframe paths; satellite redirects work; standalone Data still has Dashboard.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Peer default | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/pages/PlatformPeerFrame.tsx` |
| Nav icons | `webonone-v2/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` |
| Embed verify | `data/frontend` AppLayout / PlatformEmbedLayout / FeaturePages for six list routes |
| Identity rewrite | `identity/frontend/src/features/shell/config/navItems.ts` |
| Email / SMS parse | `email/.../externalNavActions.ts`, `sms/...` equivalents as needed |
| Data icons (optional) | `data/frontend/src/features/shell/config/coreNavItems.ts` (if present) |

**Reference:** Email/SMS peer wiring in the same WebOnOne files; [1.12.1](../1.12.1/02-webonone-sms-nav.md), [1.12.2](../1.12.2/02-webonone-email-send-queue-nav.md).

**Verify:** `npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root` (+ data-root / identity-root / email-root / sms-root as touched)

---

## Forbidden

- Reimplementing Data catalog pages inside `webonone-v2`
- Auth-code full-page redirect for WebOnOne left-nav Data clicks (use embed)
- Per-route `VITE_DATA_*_URL` env keys
- Showing Data group to `member` nav variant
- Putting Dashboard / Data Catalog in the **core** Data group in this spec
- Adding editor deep-links (`/tags/new`, `/products/:id`) as separate core nav items

---

## Acceptance (quick)

1. WebOnOne admin → Data → each of six items embeds correct Data list route.
2. Member → no Data menu.
3. Satellite → Data sub-item → correct Data path.
4. Standalone Data still shows Dashboard.
5. Type-checks green for touched packages/services.
